We're interested in people's knowledge of the arts---how much they know abou...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>ART KNOWLEDGE SURVEY<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>We're interested in people's knowledge of the arts---how much they know about different artists, ideas, concepts, and techniques in the world of art.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>The following page has a list of 36 artists and terms in art history. For each one, please rate how much you know about it.<br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>There are no right or wrong answers, and we appreciate your time and attention.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"AF36_Instructions","QuestionID":"QID33"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cvjcRZL9VtbnVC6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID38","SecondaryAttribute":"ART KNOWLEDGE SURVEY We're interested in people's knowledge of the arts---how much they know abou...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>ART KNOWLEDGE SURVEY<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>We're interested in people's knowledge of the arts---how much they know about different artists, ideas, concepts, and techniques in the world of art.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>The following page has a list of 10 artists and terms in art history. For each one, please rate how much you know about it.<br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>There are no right or wrong answers, and we appreciate your time and attention.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"ART KNOWLEDGE SURVEY We're interested in people's knowledge of the arts---how much they know abou...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>ART KNOWLEDGE SURVEY<\/d